data/**

# Never bake secrets into an image layer.  backend/ai/mcp/Dockerfile is the one
# Dockerfile that COPYs the repo wholesale, so without this backend/.env - now
# holding MCP_KEY as well as TELEGRAF_KEY - ends up baked into the mcp image.
# The mcp service bind-mounts ./backend over /app/backend at runtime, so the
# real .env is still there where it is needed.
**/.env
